# Migrations

Nucleus uses Alembic autogenerate (`alembic revision --autogenerate`). Schema changes belong in SQLAlchemy models only.

- Do not create, edit, or commit files under `migrations/versions/`, `migrations/manual/`, or any `*.sql` migration.
- Do not run `alembic revision` unless the user explicitly asks.
- If a table or column is needed, change the model and stop. The user generates the migration.
